docs {
  # Create Group Announcement

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/groups/:groupID/announcements`
  **Auth:** Required (Group Owner)

  ## Description

  Allows the group owner to broadcast a custom announcement with arbitrary title and message to all active group members. The owner themselves is excluded from receiving duplicate self-notifications. Persists notification records in the database for all members and immediately publishes a `group.announcement` event to RabbitMQ for real-time WebSocket delivery.

  ## Request

  ### Path Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `groupID` | `integer` | Yes | Target group ID |

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `title` | `string` | Yes | Custom announcement title (1 to 200 characters) |
  | `message` | `string` | Yes | Custom announcement text body (1 to 2000 characters) |

  ## Response

  **`201 Created`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "dispatched_count": 4,
      "group_id": 1
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Invalid payload or empty message
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid access token
  * `403 Forbidden` — Caller is not the owner of the group
  * `404 Not Found` — Group not found
}
